      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pre-go-live; periodic rebaseline
Frequency: Per new site + annual
Volume: ~25–60 staff per dark store (Pickers, Packers, Stage/Dispatch, Leads, Dark Store Supervisor)
Owner: Dark Store Operations Manager
Participants: Dark Store Ops Mgr, HR, Learning &amp; Dev, Safety
Source: workflow W3093 — Dark Store Staffing Model, Recruitment &amp; Training</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3093_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3093_Lane1" name="Dark Store Operations Manager">
