    <bpmn:process id="W_W3096" name="W3096. Dark Store Closure, Migration &amp; Decommissioning" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site underperforming, lease expiry, network re-optimization, or relocation
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Per dark store
Owner: Dark Store Operations Manager
Participants: Dark Store Ops Mgr, Real Estate, Finance, IT, HR, Inventory, Records
Source: workflow W3096 — Dark Store Closure, Migration &amp; Decommissioning</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3096_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3096_Lane1" name="Network Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3096_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3096_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3096_Lane2" name="Inventory Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3096_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3096_Lane3" name="Real Estate">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3096_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3096_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3096_Start5" name="Site underperforming, lease expiry, network re-optimization, or relocation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3096_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3096_Task6" name="Network Planning/Finance confirm closure/relocation business case; OMS (links…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Planning/Finance confirm closure/relocation business case; OMS (links to VS-60) replans catchment orders to alternate dark stores / ship-from-store ahead of cutover; customers notified of any SLA change
Responsible (R): Network Planning / Ecommerce Ops
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 2–4 weeks plan</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3096_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3096_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3096_Task7" name="Inventory Mgr executes clean-down: sell-through, transfer to alternate dark…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Inventory Mgr executes clean-down: sell-through, transfer to alternate dark store / DC (links to VS-05), or markdown; reconciles to zero on hand before handover; WMS/automation vendor decommissions equipment
Responsible (R): Inventory Manager / Vendor
Accountable (A): Dark Store Operations Manager
Duration: 2–4 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3096_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3096_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3096_Task8" name="Real Estate terminates lease, recovers deposit, hands back premises (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Real Estate terminates lease, recovers deposit, hands back premises (links to VS-20/VS-42); HR redeploys/redundancies staff per VS-19/VS-84; IT decomms systems &amp; data (links to VS-88 records retention); close capex/asset register per VS-35
Responsible (R): Real Estate / HR / IT / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 4–8 weeks</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3096_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3096_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3096_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3096_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3096_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-508 (ensure controlled execution — Dark Store Site Strategy, Design &amp; Network Planning (PA-93.1).) | - operational: 2–4 week clean-down and transfer-first policy
Owner: Dark Store Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
